# STORY (Year 1 research + story). The interrogation spine: the 29-step chain from the master doc, as research.
# Overrides the prisoner topics in gijoe_campaign.rul (loads after it). Steps past Act 1 are stubs: correct names
# and needs, reachable only once their prisoner or item exists. STR_STORY_LOCK is never researchable; a topic that
# depends on it only opens through another topic's unlocks. Text is in extraStrings below.
# Rule (John 12 Nov): a prisoner only knows what Cobra has already built or researched.
